{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JOS","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"約書亞記","commonName":"約書亞記","title":"約書亞記","order":6,"numberOfChapters":24,"sha256":"fb26417ceb168e7629022de9a02c144329d5b24a06f89f1b31937f655bc96a8f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":24,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOS/24.json","totalNumberOfVerses":654},"chapter":{"number":12,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["被擊敗的諸王"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以色列人在約旦河東岸殺死了兩個王，佔據了他們的領土：自亞嫩谷直到黑門山，包括東面的整個亞拉巴。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["這兩個王一個是住在希實本的亞摩利王西宏。他統轄的地區從亞嫩谷旁的亞羅珥，包括山谷中部和基列的一半，直到亞捫人邊境的雅博河。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他的領土還包括約旦河谷東部：從加利利湖至亞拉巴海，也就是鹽海，到伯·耶施末，直到毗斯迦的山麓。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["另一個王是巴珊王噩，他原是利乏音的遺民，住在亞斯她錄和以得來。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["他所統轄的地區包括黑門山、撒迦、整個巴珊，直到基述人和瑪迦人的邊境，還包括基列的另一半，直到希實本王西宏的國界。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["耶和華的僕人摩西帶領以色列人征服了這兩個王，並把他們的土地分給呂便支派、迦得支派和瑪拿西半個支派的人作產業。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["約書亞帶領以色列人征服了約旦河西的諸王，佔領的土地包括從黎巴嫩谷地的巴力·迦得直到西珥的哈拉山。約書亞按以色列的支派把這些土地分給以色列人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["那裡有山區、丘陵、河谷、山坡、曠野和南地，就是赫人、亞摩利人、迦南人、比利洗人、希未人、耶布斯人住的地方。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["這些王是耶利哥王、伯特利附近的艾王、"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["耶路撒冷王、希伯崙王、"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["耶末王、拉吉王、"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["伊磯倫王、基色王、"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["底璧王、基德王、"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["何珥瑪王、亞拉得王、"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["立拿王、亞杜蘭王、"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["瑪基大王、伯特利王、"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["他普亞王、希弗王、"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["亞弗王、拉沙崙王、"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["瑪頓王、夏瑣王、"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["伸崙·米崙王、押煞王、"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["他納王、米吉多王、"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["基低斯王、迦密附近的約念王、"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["多珥山上的多珥王、吉甲的戈印王、"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["得撒王，共三十一個王。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOS/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOS/13.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOS/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":24}